{'symbol': 'WAB', 'date': '2022-10-21 16:00:00', 'title': 'WABTEC DECLARES REGULAR QUARTERLY COMMON DIVIDEND', 'text': 'PITTSBURGH--(BUSINESS WIRE)--WABTEC CORPORATION (NYSE: WAB) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS DECLARED A REGULAR QUARTERLY COMMON DIVIDEND OF 15 CENTS PER SHARE, PAYABLE ON NOVEMBER 28, 2022 TO HOLDERS OF RECORD ON NOVEMBER 14, 2022.'}